{
  "$description": "Collection Item 家族配方：尺寸节奏、内容列、上下文与状态矩阵只有这一份生成真源；组件只投影角色、上下文与状态事实。浮层集合（overlay）选中 = 透明底 + 行尾对号；页内持久集合（page）选中 = 品牌淡底行面 + 前导对号，导航当前页（current）= 品牌淡底行面 + 起始侧 2px 指示条；横向导航（nav：Tabs line trigger / Anchor link / Breadcrumb link / Menubar 与 NavigationMenu trigger）自带一整套白底承载阶梯：rest 透明面 + muted 字，hover 100 → pressed 200 只换面，open-path 与 hover 同档，current = 透明面 + --xh-fg-brand-strong + medium（指示条不由配方画），terminal = 不可点的当前页（--xh-fg-default + medium，无 hover / pressed）。page 选中态的说明行保留 muted 前景，与正文维持层级；分类依据见设计真源 §7.2「浮层瞬态 vs 页内持久」与 §7.3「导航当前页」。",
  "version": 3,
  "sizes": ["sm", "md", "lg"],
  "columns": ["prefix", "text", "description", "shortcut", "suffix", "indicator"],
  "contexts": ["overlay", "page", "nav"],
  "states": ["rest", "hover", "keyboard-highlight", "pressed", "open-path", "checked", "disabled", "loading", "error"],
  "contextStates": {
    "overlay": ["selected", "selected+hover", "selected+highlight", "selected+pressed"],
    "page": ["selected", "selected+hover", "selected+highlight", "selected+pressed", "current", "current+hover", "current+highlight", "current+pressed"],
    "nav": ["rest", "hover", "keyboard-highlight", "pressed", "open-path", "current", "current+hover", "current+highlight", "current+pressed", "terminal"]
  },
  "markers": {
    "$description": "标记类型按上下文固定：overlay 对号在行尾；page 对号在行首（前导标记），current 只由品牌淡底行面与字色表达、不另画起始侧指示条（SideNav 当前项，2026-09-22 起）；bar 那组尺寸留给显式写 current: bar 的语境。nav 不画对号也不按条目画指示条：nav 的 2px 指示条是组件自己的滑动 indicator 部件（Tabs / Anchor / NavigationMenu），机器量几何、皮肤画在 list 上；无该部件时 Tabs / Anchor 由自己的皮肤在当前项上画一条静态线；NavigationMenu 的部件指的是开着的面板，当前页链接的静态线始终由自己的皮肤画、不随部件收起；Breadcrumb / Menubar 无指示条。",
    "overlay": { "glyph": "trailing", "current": "none" },
    "page": { "glyph": "leading", "current": "none" },
    "nav": { "glyph": "none", "current": "none" },
    "bar": {
      "thickness": "var(--xh-stroke-thick)",
      "blockInset": "var(--xh-space-1)",
      "radius": "var(--xh-shape-pill)"
    }
  },
